## Development loop

1. Synchronize the locked environment after dependency changes.
2. Write or update meaningful tests for behavior changes and defects.
3. Make the smallest complete change.
4. Run the fast feedback checks.
5. Update affected documentation and configuration.
6. Run every required verification gate before completion.
7. Review the final diff for unrelated files, secrets and generated artifacts.

